{"id":"vod_sn_36742","vodId":"36742","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"德鲁亚加之塔 ～乌鲁克之剑～","name_cn":"德鲁亚加之塔 ～乌鲁克之剑～","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/820bdfe8b9c2bc01403e5c6f34848c00.jpg"},"summary":"自从第三次的阿努的夏天结束，基鲁与法提娜由塔的顶峰送回起点“塔内都市”梅斯克亚，时间不经不觉又过了半年…当分别以基鲁及尼巴为首的两队登顶者、以及凯尔布率领的乌鲁克军辛苦攻上了迷宫塔之顶层，大家都以为打败邪神便能获得传说之蓝水晶杖并结束这个旅程，怎料事实却并非所料：秘密、背叛、谎言…一一眼前；原来局中有局，这儿才是真正故事的开始！尼巴及卡雅的身影与幻境之塔一同消失；主人翁基鲁及法蒂娜无奈地被送回旅程的起点，而其他同伴则下落不明。但是，基鲁再一次下定决心，誓要再次踏上迷宫塔的顶层，进入幻境之塔内，解开所有迷团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KFTqFcFbqA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zHHLn4qgYf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jy5XZGvrzh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c3XqEganQp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q2msYifF3M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wU3W6XZW6A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ge0YbcFLGy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C6jzE3gma11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XF0KQsmE9A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/336NBLy0rG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gaN1i04DMc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AGastvwMTg1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.286Z"}